## Initial-state note
The game's initial screen IS the help screen: PlayingField ctor calls
GenHelpScreen() (playingField.H:142). title.png and help.png are therefore
pixel-identical BY CONSTRUCTION pre-refactor (verified: compare AE = 0 between
them too). They are kept as separate artifacts because post-migration states may
diverge (e.g. harness-driven transitions).

